  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">evaluate the impact of climatic, physical, cultural, and environmental factors in the understanding of the settlement and occupation of Australia and the Indo-Pacific.</rdfs:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

